---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant DB as Evaluators DB

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo evaluator publish
    activate Vigilo

    alt Source directory
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Resolve source profile, WIT file and package identity
    else Portable directory or archive
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Read bounded manifest and Wasm without extraction
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Verify artifact hash and embedded package identity
    end
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Resolve exact supported WIT ABI and contract hash
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Compile Wasm and typed-link selected adapter
    Vigilo->>DB: Check evaluator version uniqueness
    alt Same identity and content hash already exist
        DB-->>Vigilo: Existing evaluator
        Vigilo-->>User: Idempotent success
    else Version available
        DB-->>Vigilo: Version available

    Vigilo->>DB: Check evaluator hash uniqueness
    DB-->>Vigilo: Hash available

    Vigilo->>DB: Insert Wasm, artifact hash, contract hash, and adapter id
    DB-->>Vigilo: Saved

    Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    end
    deactivate Vigilo
